**Description**

crm/test_crm.py all erroring out after PR 5331 got merged. PortChannel09 in this case is backend port channel. Before this PR all testcases were passing.

FYI @abdosi 

    @pytest.fixture(scope=&quot;function&quot;, autouse=True)
